 "text": "-->\nGrainland Farmers - Homepage\n-->\nHomepage\nToggle Navigation\nGRAIN -->\nGRAIN\nGuy's Commentary\nUSDA News & Reports\nFutures Overview\nOptions\nReport Schedule\nContract Definitions\nLOCATIONS\nABOUT US -->\nABOUT US\nAbout Grainland Farmers\nStaff\nDirectors\nHoliday Schedule\nPATRON ACCESS\nRESOURCES\nDOCS & POLICIES\nSIGN UP\nEMPLOYMENT\nGRAIN\nGuy's Commentary\nUSDA News & Reports\nFutures Overview\nOptions\nReport Schedule\nContract Definitions\nLOCATIONS\nABOUT US\nAbout Grainland Farmers\nStaff\nDirectors\nHoliday Schedule\nPictures\nPATRON ACCESS\nEMPLOYMENT\n-->\nResources |\n|\nDocs & Policies |\n|\nSign Up |\n|\nAnnouncements |\nPrevious\nNext\n-->\n-->\nGrainland Farmers is engaged in 45Z opportunities, working to create value for our farmers and strengthen our position in the emerging low-carbon grain market.\nThere has been a lot of discussion surrounding 45Z programs as we have moved into harvest over the past couple weeks. With multiple locations well positioned for potential 45Z opportunities, along with our access to rail, we believe Grainland Farmers will have more opportunities for participation in these programs.\nWe continue to do our due diligence, as we never want to overpromise and underdeliver. Please be patient and know that we are actively working to identify opportunities that can help add value to your farming operation.\nThere is absolutely no rush to commit to any program at this time. Opportunities for the 2026 crop will continue to evolve well beyond harvest.\nIf you have questions or would like additional information, please contact anyone at\nGrainland Farmers.\n-->\nCASH BIDS\nCorn\n|\n|\n|\n|\n|\n|\nName\n| Notes\n| Basis Month\n| Cash Price\n| Futures Change\n| Basis\n|\nCorn | FALL 26 | December 2026 | $4.38 | -3-6 | -36 |\nCorn | JAN 27 | March 2027 | $4.53 | -4-4 | -33 |\nCorn | FALL 27 | December 2027 | $4.67 | -2-4 | -40 |\nSoybeans\n|\n|\n|\n|\n|\n|\nName\n| Notes\n| Basis Month\n| Cash Price\n| Futures Change\n| Basis\n|\nSoybeans | FALL 26 | November 2026 | $12.21 | -1-6 | -40 |\nSoybeans | JAN 27 | January 2027 | $12.46 | -2-0 | -30 |\nSoybeans | FALL 27 | November 2027 | $11.96 | +1-6 | -45 |\nWheat\n|\n|\n|\n|\n|\n|\nName\n| Notes\n| Basis Month\n| Cash Price\n| Futures Change\n| Basis\n|\nWheat | CASH | December 2026 | $6.20 | -9-4 | -40 |\nWheat | JULY 27 | July 2027 | $6.13 | -7-0 | -70 |\nView all cash prices...\nQuotes are delayed, as of October 18, 2026, 11:02:54 AM CDT or prior.\nAll grain prices are subject to change at any time.\nCash bids are based on 10-minute delayed futures prices, unless otherwise noted.\nReminders\nTo view the 2026 Wheat Policy, click here !\nClick HERE to see how our Average Pricing Program finished up this year!!\nWe offer direct deposit! Fill out the direct deposit form under the 'Docs and Policies' tab and either email it to info@grainlandfarmers.com , mail it in, or drop it off at any of our locations.\nDon't forget to check out the latest market news under 'Guys Commentary' where he discusses what's trending and market news.\nLIVESTOCK FUTURES\nName | Month | Last | Change | High | Low | Volume |\nLive Cattle | October 2026 | 227.550s | +1.600 | 227.800 | 226.000 | 3123 |\nLive Cattle | December 2026 | 228.350s | +1.100 | 228.750 | 227.075 | 20122 |\nLive Cattle | February 2027 | 230.875s | +1.250 | 231.150 | 229.550 | 12912 |\n|\nFeeder Cattle | October 2026 | 343.625s | +0.250 | 345.125 | 343.100 | 1046 |\nFeeder Cattle | November 2026 | 341.900s | -0.050 | 343.525 | 341.375 | 6822 |\nFeeder Cattle | January 2027 | 338.275s | +0.375 | 339.500 | 337.150 | 6911 |\n|\nLean Hogs | February 2027 | 69.225s | +0.775 | 69.625 | 68.250 | 15050 |\nLean Hogs | April 2027 | 74.675s | +1.250 | 74.975 | 73.300 | 7183 |\nQuotes are delayed, as of October 18, 2026, 11:02:54 AM CDT or prior.\nFUTURES\nName | Month | Last | Change | High | Low | Percent |\nCorn | December 2026 | 474-2s | -3-6 | 481-0 | 473-0 | -0.78% |\nCorn | March 2027